{"id":"sistema","lemma":"sistema","pos":"noun","rank":513,"glosses":["system","scheme (a systematic plan of future action; also, a group of independent but interrelated elements comprising a unified whole)","the establishment"],"ipa":"/sisˈtema/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sistemas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sistema.wav","examples":[{"text":"Este sistema funciona.","en":"This system works.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/872079","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"}]},{"text":"Es un sistema que funciona.","en":"It's a system that works.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611894","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"}]},{"text":"Nos encanta el sistema.","en":"We love the system.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800343","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to charm, to enchant","l":"encantar"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El sistema funcionaba bien.","en":"The system worked well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461487","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"Tenemos un buen sistema de calefacción.","en":"We have a good heating system.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589746","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"heating"}]}]}